        "description": "<div id=\"link_wrapped_content\">\n<body><section class=\"wp-block-bigbite-multi-title\"><div class=\"container\"></div></section>\n\n\n\n<p>The importance of backing up your Windows PC or laptop is incontrovertible. Just think about all your data that could be at risk due to mechanical failure, natural disaster, or bad actor \u2014 if you didn\u2019t have a solid backup. The best Windows backup includes file backup, sure, but also disk imaging and full image restore, as well as disaster recovery.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Our picks for best Windows backup software are selected with the full scope of data backup and recovery in mind, to keep the tears to a minimum if and when your primary local data repository is compromised.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"what-backup-utilities-come-with-windows\">What backup utilities come with Windows?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Sadly, while other operating systems make backup easy, Microsoft saddles users with a patchwork system of utilities and holdover imaging tools from Windows 7. </p>\n\n\n\n",
